{"ts":"2026-07-06T22:29:52.125Z","author":"codex-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-kexu"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"update-many --dry-run should allow filter-only preview for audit and bulk-selection workflows"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"During the 2026-07-06/07 all-status ecosystem audit, 'pm update-many --filter-status open --filter-metadata-missing --dry-run --limit 200 --json' failed because no mutation flags were provided. That is defensible for mutation execution, but dry-run is also the natural safe preview for bulk-selection filters. Duplicate check: searched all statuses for update-many dry-run no mutation flags filter-only audit; only closed pm-twtu covers the generic error message, while no open item tracks filter-only dry-run preview support."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:cli","audit","bulk-ops"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T22:29:52.125Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T22:29:52.125Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"update-many --dry-run can return the matched item set/count when only filters are provided, without requiring a dummy mutation flag; output is bounded and scriptable in json/toon; existing mutation-required behavior remains for non-dry-run execution; tests cover no-mutation dry-run, no-mutation real run, and at least one metadata filter."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"project management = context management"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Make bulk-selection filters safely inspectable before mutation"},{"op":"add","path